.TH AVR\-ORG 1 "" "avr 0.1.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org \- Manage organizations and installations.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage organizations and installations.
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
create
Create a new organization.
.TP
email-domain
Manage email domains for automatic org membership.
.TP
install
Manage GitHub App installations.
.TP
list
List organizations you belong to.
.TP
members
List organization members (admin only).
